  "prefLabel": "Alc 404.01 Required Supervision of CRSWs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 404.01 Required Supervision of CRSWs. A CRSW shall be supervised:\n\n(a) By one or more supervisors meeting one of the descriptions set forth in Alc 404.02; and\n\n(b) For at least 3 nonconsecutive hours per month while actively practicing.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18; ss by #14045, eff 10-7-24",
